---
import Legal from '../../layouts/Legal.astro';
import { SITE } from '../../lib/site';
---
<Legal title="Affiliate Disclosure" updated="September 2026">
  <p><em>Transparency about how some links on this site work.</em></p>

  <h2>1. Some links are affiliate links</h2>
  <p>Parts lists and resource sections on {SITE.name} may contain <strong>affiliate links</strong> to stores such as Amazon, Robu and others. If you buy through one of these links, we may earn a small commission.</p>

  <h2>2. It never costs you extra</h2>
  <p>You pay the same price whether you use our link or not. The commission comes from the store, not from you, and it helps keep the projects and guides free.</p>

  <h2>3. How links are marked</h2>
  <p>Affiliate links are clearly labelled (for example with an “ad” tag next to the Buy button) and this disclosure appears near parts lists. We only link to components we actually used or genuinely recommend.</p>

  <h2>4. No influence on content</h2>
  <p>Earning a commission never changes what we build or recommend. Prices shown are indicative and were checked on the date noted; always confirm the current price and specification on the store before buying.</p>

  <h2>5. Programme affiliations</h2>
  <p>Where applicable, {SITE.name} participates in affiliate programmes (such as the Amazon Associates Programme). As an affiliate we earn from qualifying purchases. This disclosure is provided in line with those programmes' terms and applicable advertising norms.</p>

  <h2>6. Contact</h2>
  <p>Questions? Reach us via the <a href="/contact">contact page</a> or at {SITE.email}.</p>
</Legal>
